2025-10-16T18:09:55 |executable as Perl uses it to test module features. Stay close to
2025-10-16T18:09:55 |upstream. During regress, set the x-bit of the files in obj
2025-10-16T18:09:56 |directory. Do not touch src tree, it might be read-only.
2025-10-16T18:09:56 |
